Package: mHapDMR
Title: Differential M-score Analysis from mHap Files Using DSS
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Jiantao", "Shi", email = "jtshi@cmpt.ac.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads mHap-format sequencing files (bgzipped, tabix-indexed) and
    CpG position files to compute M-score statistics for genomic intervals
    stored as GRanges. M-score is defined as the weighted methylation level
    across all reads in a region (sum of per-read CpG-weighted methylation
    divided by total CpG count). The package transforms M-score into DSS-
    compatible input via the kappa/Y' substitution and performs differential
    M-score analysis using DSS::DMLfit.multiFactor().
